+- Entities: `entities`/`entity_memberships` data model with a database-enforced single owner (`owner_seq` + `entity_memberships_one_owner`), `UserRole` enum, `Entity`/`EntityMembership` models and factories, `EntityPolicy`/`EntityMembershipPolicy`, entity picker (`POST entity.pick` with audit log), and Livewire entity dashboard/members/settings pages with owner-only settings and ownership transfer.
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
